ion-all\" width=\"648\" height=\"416\"></a></div><div class=\"mt-2 mb-6 lg:mb-0 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-2\" id=\"badges-desktop\"><a href=\"/en/question_categories/shipping\" class=\"inline-flex relative items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-2 py-1 text-xs font-semibold leading-none shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md hover:opacity-95 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-zest tooltip after:bg-black after:text-xs after:text-white cursor-pointer bg-indigo-50 border-indigo-600 text-indigo-900\" target=\"_blank\" data-tooltip-text=\"Transport can be arranged for this vehicle.\"><i class=\"icon text-base leading-none\">local_shipping</i><span>Transport available</span></a></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-neutral-500 mt-8 mb-6 justify-between md:justify-start\"><a href=\"#data-sheet\" class=\"flex pb-3 border-black gap-2 items-center text-sm sm:text-base border-b text-black\">Overview</a><a href=\"#bid-container\" class=\"flex pb-3 border-black gap-2 items-center text-sm sm:text-base\"><span>Bids</span><span class=\"text-xs h-5 px-2 rounded-full bg-neutral-500 text-off-white flex items-center justify-center\">19</span></a><a href=\"#comments\" class=\"flex pb-3 border-black gap-2 items-center text-sm sm:text-base\"><span>Comments</span><span class=\"text-xs h-5 px-2 rounded-full bg-neutral-500 text-off-white flex items-center justify-center\">2</span></a><a href=\"/en/auctions/1991-jeep-wrangler-40-4wd-ses562/albums\" class=\"flex pb-3 border-black gap-2 items-center text-sm sm:text-base\"><span>Photos</span><span class=\"text-xs h-5 px-2 rounded-full bg-neutral-500 text-off-white flex items-center justify-center\">229</span></a></div><div class=\"mb-8 p-6 bg-white rounded-lg border-l-4 border-racing-700\"><blockquote class=\"mb-4\"><p class=\"md:text-lg italic text-neutral-700 mb-0\">“Capable offroader inviting to adventure! ”</p></blockquote><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><img src=\"/assets/jacob-odqvist-44be25a1.jpg\" alt=\"Jacob Odqvist\" class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full\"><div><div class=\"text-sm md:text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900\">Jacob Odqvist</div><div class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-neutral-600\">Responsible consignor</div></div></div></div><h2 class=\"font-semibold text-xl mb-4\" id=\"data-sheet\">Data sheet</h2><ul class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 mb-8 max-w-3xl\"><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Year: </span><span>1991</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Manufacturer: </span><span>Jeep</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Model: </span><span>Wrangler</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Color: </span><span>Red</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Interior color: </span><span>Beige</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Interior material: </span><span>Leather</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Engine displacement: </span><span>4.0</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Drive: </span><span>All-wheel drive</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Propulsion: </span><span>Gasoline</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Steering: </span><span>LHD</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Transmission: </span><span>Manual</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Odometer: </span><span>149 500 km</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-1 col-span-2\"><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">VIN: </span><span class=\"flex gap-1 items-center relative\"><span>2J4FY29S6********</span><span class=\"bg-red-50 border-rose-100 text-au-chico tooltip after:bg-red-50 after:border-rose-100 rounded-full flex items-center\" data-tooltip-text=\"To view this vehicle's VIN number you'll need be logged in. Create your account now, it only takes a minute!\"><span class=\"icon\">info</span></span></span></li></ul><div class=\"video-container w-full relative mb-8\"><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VZcOsb1-gCU?si=XC0LpYxbz7JGeq74\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></div><div class=\"auction-body\"><h2>Basic information and history</h2><p>In 1986, Jeep launched its Wrangler model (internal code YJ) and the characteristic rectangular headlights made their way onto the scene. For the 1991 model year, a new fuel-injected 4.0-liter six was introduced, which this vehicle has. The classic Jeep design is recognizable from its predecessor (internal code CJ) as well as the robustness that characterizes the brand. This model offers the genuine Jeep feel paired with capable accessibility and just the right modifications.</p><p>This example was originally imported from the USA and has had four previous private users before the current owner. The odometer reading is <strong>92,733 miles</strong>, 149 500 km, but it cannot be confirmed by documentation. This Wrangler has been the subject of extensive repainting and has been rustproofed. With its authentic condition – including original hardtop, soft top and summer doors – this is a classic to enjoy.</p><h2>Equipment and options</h2><ul>\n<li>Fixed towbar</li>\n<li>LED ramp</li>\n<li>LED auxiliary lights</li>\n<li>Soft top</li>\n<li>Bikini top</li>\n<li>Hard top</li>\n<li>Winch</li>\n<li>Height</li>\n<li>Summer doors</li>\n</ul><p><strong>Modifications and improvements:</strong></p><p>The vehicle is equipped and modified for both adventurous off-road driving and practical use. Among the equipment is powerful additional lighting via LED ramp and additional lights as well as a robust winch to facilitate difficult terrain. The paint has been completely renovated and the vehicle is also extra protected with anti-rust treatment. Several types of tops and doors are included for flexible use throughout the year.</p><h2>Condition</h2><p><strong>Body &amp; Exterior Condition:</strong> The body is in good condition but there are minor marks in the paint and around the car (see pictures to get an idea of ​​the condition). The car has previously been repainted and anti-rust treated.</p><p><strong>Interior:</strong> The interior has <em>full leather in a well maintained condition</em>. Steering wheel, controls and buttons are in working order and well maintained. The headliner is in good condition.</p><p><strong>Tires &amp; Rims:</strong> Sits on <em>almost new</em> <strong>BF Goodrich Mud-Terrain T/A</strong>.</p><p><strong>Mechanics &amp; Function: </strong>The engine is serviced and runs well, brakes work satisfactorily and the gearbox feels tight without any noise or play. The drivetrain is healthy and there are no known problems.</p><h2>Service History</h2><p>Some documentation on service is available. The last approved inspection was carried out on <strong>2024-03-05</strong>, and the next inspection is not due until <strong>2026-03-31</strong>. Service has been carried out continuously and some service papers and receipts are included with the car. The car has also received a <em>full service</em> on the engine.</p><h2>Summary</h2><p>Here is an iconic and well maintained <strong>Jeep Wrangler YJ</strong> with the right setup and in excellent condition. Perfect for adventures in the wild or cruising summer streets..</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-neutral-300 text-sm text-neutral-500 mb-12\">The description of this auction item is, to the seller's knowledge, accurate and not misleading. Bidders Highway gathers details from the seller and performs some background checks, but does not carry out a full inspection, and the transaction is between the buyer and the seller. It is up to the bidder to ensure the description is correct and to do any research they deem necessary before placing a binding bid. <b>Study the many images carefully and form your own opinion on the condition, and use the comments section to ask questions.</b> See our general terms and conditions for full details.</div><div class=\"lg:hidden mb-6 text-sm\"><div class=\"text-center\">Do you also own a Jeep Wrangler or similar? <a class=\"underline hover:text-zest transition-colors\" href=\"/en/sales_inquiries/new\">Contact us</a> and we'll quickly put you in touch with our sales specialists.</div></div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\">2 Comments</h2><div class=\"mb-16\"><span class=\"block border bg-rose-50 text-neutral-600 p-4 my-4 rounded\">You need to be signed in in order to post comments.</span><ul id=\"comments\"><li id=\"comment_019a746c-9aa5-7f6c-acd4-d6e12cdc9e46\" class=\"comment transition-colors mt-6 mb-2\"><div class=\"flex gap-2 text-lg items-center mb-2\"><strong class=\"font-semibold text-sm md:text-base\">olte</strong><span class=\"text-neutral-500 text-sm md:text-base\">November 11, 2025 20:37</span></div><div class=\"text-neutral-700 pb-2\"><p>vilka diff möjligheter har den</p></div></li><li id=\"comment_019a78d9-7efd-70ea-ba85-66bb3ebe4232\" class=\"comment transition-colors pl-4 py-1 pb-2 lg:ml-2 border-l-neutral-300 border-l\"><div class=\"flex gap-2 text-lg items-center mb-2\"><strong class=\"font-semibold text-sm md:text-base\">Abousale</strong><span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-700 font-normal bg-white rounded-full inline-block py-1 px-2 whitespace-nowrap\">Seller</span><span class=\"text-neutral-500 text-sm md:text-base\">November 12, 2025 17:15</span></div><div class=\"text-neutral-700 pb-2\"><p>Alla 4WD är utrustade med diffspärr fram och bakaxel </p></div></li></ul></div><h2 class=\"font-serif uppercase text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-racing-700 mb-6\">Similar listings</h2><div id=\"recommended-listings\" class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3 mb-16\"><div id=\"auction_01a0fde2-95cb-70ab-b479-837eb1dce368_listing_card\" class=\"listing-card h-full w-full mb-8 md:mb-0 relative flex flex-col justify-between\"><a href=\"/en/auctions/2001